sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor Player
participant Router as Wouter routes
participant Session as Supabase Auth SDK session provider
participant Page as Pages and reusable UI components
participant API as Typed HTTP API
participant Auth as Supabase Auth
participant DB as Transaction repository
participant Feed as Private Realtime
Player->>Router: Open /game/{gameId}/invite using game ID as invite capability
Router->>API: GET /game/{gameId}/invite (minimal public preview)
API-->>Router: Pending status, published definition, capacity and expiry only
Router->>Session: Load or obtain Supabase Auth session before joining
alt Guest or registered login
  Session->>Auth: Direct signInAnonymously / password / PKCE OAuth / linkIdentity
  Auth-->>Session: Access JWT, refresh session and stable user UUID
else Session expired
  Session-->>Router: Authentication required
  Router-->>Player: Login page with destination retained
end
Session->>Session: Obtain fresh Supabase access JWT
Session->>API: GET /me (Authorization: Bearer access JWT)
API->>API: Verify JWT issuer, signature, audience, expiry and actor
API-->>Session: Authorized app profile
Router->>Page: Render authenticated page
alt Browse published definitions
  Page->>API: GET /definition
  API-->>Page: Published version catalog
else Create pending game
  Page->>API: POST /game (version, target size, idempotency, bearer JWT)
  API->>DB: Atomically create game and creator participant in first seat and feasible role
  DB-->>API: game_id, assigned creator role and seat, pending revision
  API-->>Page: Pending game with creator already in seat one
else Join invitation
  Page->>API: POST /game/{gameId}/join (idempotency key and Bearer JWT only)
  API->>DB: Lock game and assign lowest unoccupied seat plus first feasible role
  DB-->>API: Assigned seat and role; pending or activate exactly at target
  API-->>Page: Viewer-scoped GameView
end
Page->>API: GET /game/{gameId}
API->>DB: Check membership, load pinned version
API-->>Page: Authorized state and revision
Page->>API: GET /game/{gameId}/available-action
API-->>Page: Typed, legal, viewer-scoped actions
Page->>API: POST /game/{gameId}/realtime-grant
API-->>Page: Membership-scoped channel grant
Page->>Feed: Subscribe to private revision topic
loop One or more authorized participant commands
  Player->>Page: Choose action and typed parameters
  Page->>API: POST /game/{gameId}/action (revision, idempotency key, bearer JWT)
  API->>DB: Lock, authenticate, validate, execute and commit
  alt Accepted
    DB-->>API: New revision and immutable event
    API-->>Page: Viewer-scoped result
    DB-->>Feed: Notify committed revision
    Feed-->>Page: Revision hint (not authoritative state)
    Page->>API: Refetch state and actions by revision
    API-->>Page: Redacted updated GameView
  else Stale revision or illegal action
    API-->>Page: Typed conflict or validation error
    Page->>API: Refetch authoritative state and available actions
  else Auth/session revoked
    API-->>Page: Unauthorized or forbidden
    Page-->>Router: Return to authentication or access error
  end
end
opt Page reconnects after disconnection or mobile suspension
  Page->>API: GET /game/{gameId} with renewed session
  API-->>Page: Durable latest game revision
  Page->>Feed: Resubscribe to private topic
end
